  "details": "Precondition:\n\n1. Use VRChat on VR\n\n2. Load to any instance\n\n3. Open the camera\n\nReproduction steps:\n\n1. Set the \"Flying\" checkbox to on\n\n2. Click on the camera orientation change button\n\nExpected Result: The camera changes its orientation to portrait\n\nActual Result: The camera's orientation remains in landscape mode\n\nThe bug doesn't disappear when you exit the flight mode and switch the camera off->on. It can only be fixed by re-joining the instance",
